WEBVTT

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:02.433
12 letters. One for every

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:04.500
month since October 2025.

00:00:04.633 --> 00:00:06.167
First the month gathers

00:00:06.033 --> 00:00:07.533
itself: every race, trek,

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:08.933
book and post from the

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.600
archive. 42 km raced, 1 book,

00:00:10.467 --> 00:00:12.033
11 posts written. Nothing

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:12.500
retyped.

00:00:12.633 --> 00:00:15.467
Then I write the letter:

00:00:15.333 --> 00:00:18.333
Satara hills and a second

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:19.000
brain.

00:00:19.133 --> 00:00:21.067
Every issue, newest first:

00:00:20.933 --> 00:00:22.967
Satara hills and a second

00:00:22.833 --> 00:00:24.867
brain. Waterfalls, forts and

00:00:24.733 --> 00:00:26.533
seven builds. Hesse, the

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:28.000
Himalaya, a new site.

00:00:28.133 --> 00:00:30.533
The same page in two shells:

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:32.633
classic, clean and quick, or

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:34.833
the atlas, a town square on

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:35.500
the map.

00:00:35.633 --> 00:00:37.000
And you can write back:

00:00:36.867 --> 00:00:38.400
react, vote, rate the letter,

00:00:38.267 --> 00:00:39.700
or ask the archive about

00:00:39.567 --> 00:00:40.500
anything in it.

00:00:40.633 --> 00:00:43.833
A log is not a memory. A

00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:45.000
letter is.
